irq_domain_deactivate_irq(irq_data);
```
Reason:
The bug is fixed by adding calls to `irq_domain_deactivate_irq(irq_data)` before the activation of the interrupt. This ensures that the interrupt is properly deactivated before any new configuration is applied, thus preventing the potential for double activation and adhering to the constraints set by the recent commit.


